flowchart TD
  accTitle: The observable thinking and decision loop
  accDescr: Define the outcome, resolve the most important unknown, build a small result, inspect evidence, and choose whether to revise or finish.
  A["Name the desired outcome"] --> B["List constraints and unknowns"]
  B --> C{"Enough evidence to choose?"}
  C -->|No| D["Research or run one small experiment"]
  D --> B
  C -->|Yes| E["Choose the next useful action"]
  E --> F["Build a reviewable result"]
  F --> G["Inspect behavior and evidence"]
  G --> H{"Acceptance conditions met?"}
  H -->|No| I["Classify the failure"]
  I --> B
  H -->|Yes| J["Record the decision and finish"]
